Remove.  This should be the top level type

{
   Type: "EEPROMpt5161l"
}

@ed@tanous.net I think the latest patch addresses the discussed concerns, with the configs now separated to represent two physical interfaces, as shown below:

```
{
   Name: MyEeprom
   Bus: 1
   Address: 0x10
   Type: EEPROM_24C64

}
{
   Name: MyRetimer
   Bus: 2
   Address: 0x20
   FirmwareDevice: MyEeprom
   Type: PT51611
}
```
